WEBVTT

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.780
Why?

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:22.120
I...

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.170
<b>Satomi Kou</b>

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.120
What? I'm—

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.760
Hey, what's with that expression?

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:35.330
Was it that much of a shock?

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:37.140
I bet it was.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.680
He was your... friend, wasn't he?

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.390
Just kidding.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:44.410
I can't actually see you.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:45.960
Did I scare you?

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:50.480
Sure you're okay with this, Chinatsu-chan?

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.830
I mean, next is...

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:59.660
I told you, didn't I? There's no going back.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.010
The Two / Suzuko and Chinatsu

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.760
Welcome.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:41.940
Come in!

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.630
Hanna's in her room.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:45.890
Thanks.

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:53.210
Hanna-chan?

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:55.070
It's me, Suzuko.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.680
I made some chocolate-banana muffins.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.120
You liked these, right?

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.020
Eat them if you like.

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.360
I'll come another time.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.740
Hanna-chan!

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:22.350
Verification.

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:24.550
Chocolate-banana is divine.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:26.580
Gratitude.

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:30.680
No, it's natural for a student to 
worry about her teacher, right?

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.350
Pathetic.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.640
I'm a failure as a teacher, aren't I?

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:37.900
You sure are.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.130
Warning.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:43.930
Let me say one thing.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.260
Why not just stop fighting battles

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:51.410
and wait for the ninety-day 
time limit to run out?

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:55.080
Even if you win,

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.670
you won't be happy anymore.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.020
You're right.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:05.510
But it wasn't all bad.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:09.260
Because it brought me to you.

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.400
Agreement.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.120
You're correct.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:17.230
I don't want you to go through what I did.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:19.740
Remember what you said to me?

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:23.740
That if I had something I wanted to 
take back, I had to get serious.

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:27.490
I have that now.

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:30.040
Bondage.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:33.500
Is it no more than an obsession with the past?

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.030
It's not the past.

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:40.130
What I want is my relationships going forward.

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.090
Understood.

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.250
Thank you.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:51.720
<b>Re 
Birth</b>

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:53.390
Hanna?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.210
Did Suzuko-chan leave?

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.060
Yes.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:02.320
I finally understand.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.030
Moving forward.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:08.780
From now on, I'll only look at the future.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:12.270
I see.

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:14.550
Yeah!

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:17.670
Hey, Riru...

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:21.630
Is there something you want to protect?

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:22.910
Yes.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.780
Right now, I want to protect you.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:30.300
Thank you.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:36.210
Shirai-san?

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.570
Are you... Donor-san?

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:51.580
No...

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:56.580
Satomi used Chinatsu-chan to provoke him.

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:59.250
I forgot to say something.

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:02.300
Just don't forget your real wish.

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:07.720
And I really... I really do like...

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:10.150
Never mind. See you!

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:13.970
Let's not do this, Shou-chan.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.560
Not do what?

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:19.240
You only have one coin left!

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:19.940
So?

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:21.560
"So"?

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:24.520
One more loss, and you'll disappear!

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.900
I know what you're doing.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:30.740
You're talking a lot today.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.990
This is for Chinatsu-chan, isn't it?

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:39.810
You're fighting for her, right? Why?

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.140
I can't just leave her.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.440
Not when she's like that.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.040
I want her old self to come back.

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:52.390
The cheerful girl who was always laughing.

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:55.010
Shou-chan?

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.810
Oh, no...

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:07.700
Everything ended up like Satomi wanted.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:10.000
Then, Shirai-san...

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:10.780
Please!

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.040
Shou-chan's...

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:16.260
Shou-chan's last request...

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.740
Grant it for him.

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:19.360
Please.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:29.430
Get those new contracts in order, okay?

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:30.270
Thanks.

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:30.680
Here.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:31.540
Um...

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:33.680
You're doing it!

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:35.970
Get going!

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:43.270
<b>Contract 

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:48.990
Looks like you're having fun, Kou.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:52.280
It's such a great face, though, isn't it?

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:57.200
I'm planning to start playing soccer again.

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:01.250
I wanted to tell you here.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:06.820
Shame about Shirai-kun, isn't it?

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.920
If you'd known this would happen,

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.380
maybe you could've done more things for him.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.380
<b>Satomi Kou 
Shirai Shouhei</b>

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:18.410
Now you understand.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:20.140
It all means nothing unless you win.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:22.650
He lost.

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:23.970
Pathetically!

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:28.040
You're nearing your limit, too.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.860
Do you think...

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:32.870
you could finish things for me?

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:38.620
I know that.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:48.720
Are you scared?

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:51.420
What are you talking about?

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:54.680
It's okay.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:56.220
If you want me to do it...

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.690
Chi-chan, are you okay?

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:10.260
That's right... I wanted this.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:12.620
So that I could be the real me...

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.200
<b>Shirai Shouhei</b>

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:17.860
I said I'd erase what I didn't need.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.860
<b>Delete</b>

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.710
<b>Chi-chan
Incoming Call</b>

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:26.660
Chi-chan...

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:27.810
It's all right.

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.320
We're together.

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:34.000
Hello?

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:38.640
I'll be waiting for you tomorrow, in the park.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:39.720
Yeah.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.500
Welcome back.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:45.850
I'm home.

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:48.630
I'm about to eat dinner.

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:49.480
You?

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:51.100
I ate while I was out.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.690
I see...

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.860
<b>Chi-chan</b>

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:57.030
Then why don't I make some tea?

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.820
We haven't talked at all lately.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.940
And... um...

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:06.020
Sometimes, I wish we would.

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:08.830
You're right.

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.550
This looks great!

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:18.140
Dad's job is going well, so we 
should splurge once in a while.

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:23.670
Chinatsu, I think we can afford to send 
you to your first choice of schools.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:26.560
Thank you.

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.450
I'll be back later.

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:15.670
<i>I'll become the real me...</i>

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.170
It's all right.

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:21.160
You're strong, Chi-chan.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.570
I'm with you.

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:25.500
Let's make your wish come true.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.290
Chi-chan!

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.780
Why did you pick this place?

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:38.430
Because you love it.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:41.140
I wanted to let you see it

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.260
before your memories disappear.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:45.660
I see.

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:51.180
All of these are important memories.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:53.490
To both of us.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:58.400
I fought my battles to be rid of them.

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:01.530
I fight to protect them.

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:05.790
Open!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.500
Riru, grow.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.110
Meru, grow.

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.730
Use ARTS Seasoning,

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:44.990
and banish two cards.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.000
Riru!

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:54.610
I'm fine.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:55.620
Riru, grow.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.960
Play SIGNI, then turn end!

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:05.880
You think you can stop me from using 
Berserk and countering you?

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:08.760
I guess you've learned to think a bit.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.470
I told you that I'd become stronger.

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:13.480
But it's useless.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.780
If I don't have enough Ener, I'll just get more.

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:18.620
Spell: Three Swords.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.900
Full attack with my SIGNI!

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.230
Riru!

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.540
Keep going, Suzu.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:38.330
I will protect your feelings!

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.210
That LRIG really pisses me off.

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:43.210
It's just like...

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.810
Hey... Just disappear already, would you?

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:52.470
Free me.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:57.400
Even if I did disappear, it wouldn't free you.

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:00.310
You'd just cease to be you.

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:03.610
It doesn't matter whether I'm important to you!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:08.150
Because I'm a part of you now!

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:13.340
I thought that even if I lost some of 
my memories, I'd still be me.

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:15.790
But that's wrong.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.000
I don't want to lose them.

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:21.210
What do you know?!

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:23.920
You don't know the real me!

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:26.650
No matter what you say,

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:29.720
I'll win, and I'll be rid of you!

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:31.930
I'll bring you back!

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.270
Even if you forget, as long as I remember...

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.850
No matter how many times it takes,

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.910
I'll bring you back!

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:50.360
That's why I won't lose, no matter what!

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:52.470
Why?

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:55.800
Why are you so obsessed with me?

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:57.700
Just leave me alone!

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:59.500
I can't do that!

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.080
I can't leave you like this.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.740
Even separated from you, 
you were all I thought of!

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:06.300
I really do like...

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:07.630
Shut up!

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.040
It's too late!

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:11.200
I can't go back now!

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.740
Coin bet!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:14.770
Berserk.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:30.820
Attack with Saizou...

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.940
End of Heart.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.700
Attack with Zhurong...

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:41.460
Counter and banish.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:46.170
Attack with Zhang Jiao...

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:48.400
Knife Bat!

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:52.510
Inside-out!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:58.680
Riru?

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:01.310
Riru!

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:04.270
It's over, Suzu.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:11.500
I am... Suzu's emotions...

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:15.320
I'll make her wish come true, no matter what!

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:22.250
Just don't forget your real wish.

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.750
My real wish...

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:34.720
The light is a strange thing, isn't it?

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:38.630
<i>I hated the light.</i>

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:43.480
<i>Because it made the shadow.</i>

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:46.060
<i>So I hated it.</i>

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:49.230
<i>But even so...</i>

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:53.240
<i>Part of me wanted the light,</i>

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:56.440
<i>and I hated it.</i>

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:01.540
<i>And I hated myself for...</i>

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.550
<i>feeling that way.</i>

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:10.440
<i>I hated myself for not being able 
to be my best with you...</i>

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:16.630
<i>Don't go... Don't go...</i>

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:21.100
<i>If you were going to leave me, it'd be 
better if you were never there.</i>

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:23.210
<i>That's right.</i>

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:27.060
<i>What I wanted was to always be with you.</i>

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:31.020
<i>That's what I wanted to rid of.</i>

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:36.990
<i>I was the one who was binding myself...</i>

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:42.470
I'm sorry, Riru!

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:49.970
She undid Berserk?

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:51.600
Chi-chan?

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:55.760
No more... No more!

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:59.350
No more...

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:03.810
I don't want to lose anything else!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.520
Help me...

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:10.980
Help me, Suzu.

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:14.530
Riru!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.340
ARTS, Finishing Touches on the Fire Dragon!

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.620
Chi-chan... Chi-chan!

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:18.540
Suzu, I'm sorry.

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:24.510
I... was never the person you looked up to.

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:28.260
Whenever you were with others,

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:30.020
I'd deliberately interrupt you.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.790
I'd pretend to be helping

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:34.580
and deliberately drag you away.

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:38.400
I wanted to be the only one you cared about.

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:42.580
I didn't want to let anyone else have you!

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:48.660
You were so cheerful,

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:51.090
and you were the person I wanted to be.

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:52.690
I always...

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:58.030
I always wanted to be your real friend!

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:01.840
Me, too.

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:07.560
That's why I talked to you that time.

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:10.660
I'm Homura Suzuko.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:11.980
Who are you?

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:14.000
Suzu...

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:17.440
I'm sorry... I'm sorry!

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:22.070
I'm so glad.

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:27.260
I was so scared that you'd really leave me.

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:31.540
I was so scared... So scared!

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:34.610
I'm sorry...

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:36.000
I'm sorry.

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:56.860
Suzuko?

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:10.540
The hell is this farce?

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:14.660
Crying and apologizing while you hold 
the girl you defeated in your arms?

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.030
That's bull.

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:19.630
You said you'd finish this, didn't you?

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.620
And this is how it ends?

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:24.200
Should I finish you, then?

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.790
Wimpy little Chi-chan...

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:30.460
Well, whatever.

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:32.720
I never cared which it was to begin with.

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:39.690
I just wanted to see you two writhe in despair.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.300
Does that frustrate you?

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:44.150
Do you want to shut me up?

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:47.530
Then ignore that loser,

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:51.490
and have some fun with me, Suzuko-chan.

00:23:26.580 --> 00:23:29.360
Satisfy me, Suzuko-chan.

00:23:28.740 --> 00:23:30.510
Memories aren't garbage.

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:32.390
Come on, join me.

00:23:30.740 --> 00:23:33.990
I'm fighting the battles for what I believe in.

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:36.010
This is our battle, too!

00:23:35.410 --> 00:23:36.020
Thank you.

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:37.970
Friends forever.

00:23:38.060 --> 00:23:41.020
Dawn

00:23:38.880 --> 00:23:40.830
Next time: Dawn.
